WEBVTT

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:04.725
Detection engineering is the discipline of designing, building, maintaining, measuring,

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:07.160
documenting, and improving security detections.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:11.680
It transforms telemetry into actionable defensive visibility and depends on collaboration

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.519
across SOC,

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:17.110
threat hunting, incident response, intelligence, engineering, and operations teams.

00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:21.640
Mature programs use lifecycle management, testing, tuning, documentation, metrics,

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.805
and continuous improvement to keep detections useful over time.

00:00:24.805 --> 00:00:27.400
Detection engineering is not simply writing alerts.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:31.280
It is the engineering practice of creating reliable visibility into security-relevant

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:31.880
activity.
